# Units listed here are synced into /etc/systemd/system/ by
# scripts/deploy_server.sh on every deploy to main, and (for .timer/.path
# triggers only) enabled --now. This is a deliberate, explicit allowlist —
# NOT every file under deploy/systemd/ — because that directory also holds
# templated (@) units (qiniu-ssl-renew@.*) and manual/one-off units (e.g.
# wecom-thumbnail-backfill.service) that must never be auto-enabled.
#
# To add a new auto-managed background job: list both its .service and its
# .timer/.path here. List the .service even though it is never enabled
# directly — it still needs to land in /etc/systemd/system/ for its
# .timer/.path to be able to trigger it. Units NOT listed here keep
# following the manual install steps in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
wecom-archive-worker.service
wecom-archive-worker.timer
wecom-external-contact-reconcile.service
wecom-external-contact-reconcile.timer

# GH-106 commercial-loop executors. These are intentionally a closed set:
# billing lifecycle and notifications apply to commercial tenants; WeChat
# recovery/reconciliation query existing orders but never create checkout.
wecom-billing-lifecycle.service
wecom-billing-lifecycle.timer
wecom-billing-notifications.service
wecom-billing-notifications.timer
wecom-payment-recovery.service
wecom-payment-recovery.timer
wecom-payment-reconciliation.service
wecom-payment-reconciliation.timer
